+# of the spectrum in log-log spacing, fitting a linear equation as:
+#
+# .. math::
+#    L(log(F)) = aF + b
+#
+# Where:
+#
+# - :math:`a` is the power spectrum slope
+# - :math:`b` is the offset
+# - :math:`F` is the array of frequency values
